ners of Adam Wayne's story.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197240/extras/edd453860b7197199e1625cdd76d1c2b.poster.avif?t=1740539985\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197240/extras/edd453860b7197199e1625cdd76d1c2b.webm?t=1740539985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Immerse Yourself in an Interactive Comic</h2>Every action and choice you make in Exiler comes to life with vibrant visuals and action-packed interactive comic book action. Your story will unfold like an exciting graphic novel, where you not only observe events, but actively participate in them. The fight to save souls and bring justice becomes even more personal as you discover Adam's past.<br><br>",
